{
 "title": "Firmware Updates For N8_N8-T_N5.Rexi-T",
 "html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Board Version: N8 / N8-T / N5.Rexi-T</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time(M.D.Y)</th><th>Version</th><th>Description</th><th>Down</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>04.09.2026</td><td>C_1.4.0</td><td>Fixed string issues<br>Added support for ckpool</td><td><a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/down/c/bitdsk-miner-c.1.4.0.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Down</a></td></tr><tr><td>04.03.2026</td><td>C_1.3.9</td><td>Fixed an issue where fan speed would overlay split-screen display.</td><td><a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/down/c/bitdsk-miner-c.1.3.9.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Down</a></td></tr><tr><td>04.01.2026</td><td>C_1.3.8</td><td>1.Fixed the issue of spaces in the Wi-Fi display.<br>2.Corrected a spelling error on a webpage.<br>3.Fixed the issue of abnormal display of the 4-line fan speed.<br>4.(Important) Modified the hashrate calculation method; the hashrate will be more stable.</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>12.23.2025</td><td>C_1.3.7</td><td><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">*important</mark><br>1. Fixed the authentication method by moving the difficulty suggestion to after authentication, improving pool compatibility. 2. Fixed extranonce compatibility for 8-byte values, improving pool compatibility.</td><td><a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/down/c/bitdsk-miner-c.1.3.7.zip\">Down</a></td></tr><tr><td>12.13.2025</td><td>C_1.3.6</td><td>Cumulative repairs</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>11.07.2025</td><td>C_1.3.5</td><td>Cumulative repairs</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>11.03.2025</td><td>C_1.3.4</td><td><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">*important</mark><br>We&#8217;ve fixed a hidden bug that could cause firmware crashes and reboots.</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>11.01.2025</td><td>C_1.3.3</td><td>Cumulative repairs</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>10.31.2025</td><td>C_1.3.2</td><td>Modify the logic of subscribe.</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>10.19.2025</td><td>C_1.3.1</td><td>Adjust the HTTP server&#8217;s transmission mode to block transmission to speed up background management. Adjust the background task priority.</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>10.14.2025</td><td>C_1.2</td><td><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">*important</mark><br>Fix wifi channel.To be compatible with more routers.</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>10.11.2025</td><td>C_1.1</td><td>Socket Relink repairs</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td>&#8211;</td><td>C_1.0</td><td>Default</td><td><s>Down</s></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n",
